# U5 (9e0eab41): a paste whose end marker shares a read with more input, at
# an approval. First with no draft open (fx's decision_prompt): a `1` and an
# Enter behind an empty paste answer nothing. Then at the amendment: `keep`
# typed, `new` pasted with an Enter behind it -- the paste is kept, the
# Enter is not the answer (app_input_runtime.zig:9686-9716@481104fd). An Enter
# of its own then answers with `keepnew`. Each product gets its own turns, as
# approvals.cap: fx's `shell` is xfx's `terminal`.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: gateway approvals-fx.json
xfx: gateway approvals-xfx.json
work approvals-ws
fx: seed approvals-fx-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 4
type edit the files
key Enter
wait 4
snap asked
type [200~[201~1
wait 1.5
snap choice-paste-enter
key Tab
wait 0.5
type keep
wait 0.5
snap amend-keep
type [200~new[201~
wait 1.5
snap amend-paste-enter
key Enter
wait 3
snap answered
key Escape
wait 3
snap end
gwlog
